  "label": "Self-Esteem",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the psychological concept of self-esteem, which refers to an individual's overall sense of personal worth or value. The text 'when you are that ugly you don't have a choice' suggests that appearance negatively impacts one's self-esteem, implying that those who are perceived as 'ugly' have less control over their self-worth. This is a real-world psychological concept that is not visible in the image but is necessary to understand the meme's message.",
